.It Em run
Sort the Desktop (default command).
.Pp
Scans the top level of the root folder (~/Desktop unless the config or --root says otherwise) and moves each eligible item into its bucket folder with an atomic rename that never overwrites. Hidden items, symbolic links, bucket folders, plain folders (by default) and recently modified files (10 seconds by default) are skipped. The plan is written to the run ledger before the first move, so the run can be reversed with `dtidy undo`. A run refuses to start while an interrupted run exists; reconcile it with `dtidy recover` first.

