.Pp
Prints every move, every folder that would be created, and every skipped item with its reason, using the same rules as `dtidy run`. Nothing is changed: no files, folders, flags, ledger or lock. Each move names the rule that matched: a triage rule's name, extension, type or fallback. Skip reasons are hidden, bucket, symlink, special, folder, skip-glob, never-move and too-recent.

