List past runs, newest first.
.Pp
Lists every recorded run with its run ID, kind (sort, undo, recover), start time, state and counts. A run's state is committed, interrupted (run `dtidy recover`), recovered, partially-reverted or reverted. Runs that moved nothing write no ledger and are not listed.

