.It Em doctor
Check permissions, volume, lock, history, and config. Changes nothing.
.Pp
Reports whether the root folder is readable (and which app needs permission if it is not), whether its volume supports exclusive renames and lookup by file ID, whether the lock is free, whether any run is interrupted, and whether the config is valid. It also shows the config file and data directory in effect. Exits 0 when every check passes, otherwise 1.

